{"parentUuid":"2cf61ec0-0a45-4121-b807-80e98ba05945","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_01EV7ZFpDtrVxYcmHJHwZH22","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Google Drive에 KML 파일을 업로드했습니다.\n\n🗺️ **My Maps에서 열기**: https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1CAy4w0bY5XlJsbMRyG-DG9d1-GdQHGfv\n📎 KML 파일 (로컬): `travel-cart/nagoya-2026-07.kml`\n📎 Drive 파일: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CAy4w0bY5XlJsbMRyG-DG9d1-GdQHGfv/view\n\n핀 4개(숙소 1 + 장바구니 장소 3)가 담겨 있습니다. 좌표 정보가 없어서 주소 기반으로 표시되니, My Maps에서 열었을 때 위치가 정확한지 한 번 확인해보시는 게 좋아요.\n\n참고로 공유 권한을 자동으로 \"링크 있는 사람 누구나 보기\"로 바꿔주는 도구가 없어서, 다른 사람과 공유하시려면 My Maps 화면에서 직접 공유 설정을 열어주셔야 해요."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1149,"cache_read_input_tokens":115131,"output_tokens":535,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":115131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcdWiWepfXENnaGvR6ApJ","attributionSkill":"myrealtrip-curator:manage-travel-cart","attributionPlugin":"myrealtrip-curator","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Google Drive","attributionMcpTool":"create_file","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d04510e-9941-42b6-bf96-62c13f34004b","timestamp":"2026-07-02T16:03:12.072Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/juks86/Downloads/myrealtrip-curator","sessionId":"7b24d798-2c5a-4e6e-ab7c-29d140386938","version":"2.1.198","gitBranch":"main"}
